,"_15391":32583,"_1609":32605},[],"EBS `gp3` de al menos 50 GB",{"_8091":23,"_22651":11,"_19215":32607,"_5":22801,"_15391":32583,"_1609":32608},[],"Security Group con acceso HTTPS desde los dispositivos IoT",{"_8091":24,"_22651":24,"_5":22796,"_1609":32567,"_22809":32610,"_19215":32611,"_15391":24},[32566,32567],[],{"_8091":25,"_22651":24,"_19215":32613,"_5":22801,"_15391":24,"_1609":32614},[],"Guía de despliegue e instalación de la plataforma Lamassu IoT",{"_8091":26,"_22651":24,"_5":22806,"_19215":32616,"_15391":32617,"_1609":32618},[],"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/despliegue#onprem--selfmanaged--kubernetes","OnPrem & SelfManaged · Kubernetes",{"_8091":27,"_22651":24,"_5":22806,"_19215":32620,"_15391":32621,"_1609":32568},[],"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/despliegue#cloud--aws-ec2--aws-marketplace",{"_8091":28,"_22651":24,"_5":22806,"_19215":32623,"_15391":32624,"_1609":32625},[],"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/despliegue#saas--basada-en-suscripción","SaaS · Basada en suscripción",{"_8091":29,"_22651":24,"_19215":32627,"_5":22801,"_15391":24,"_1609":32628},[],"Bienvenido a la guía de **Despliegue de Lamassu IoT**. Selecciona la modalidad que mejor se adapta a tu infraestructura.",{"_8091":30,"_22651":24,"_19215":32630,"_5":22801,"_15391":32617,"_1609":32631},[],"<Card title=\"Introducción\" description=\"Requisitos y arquitectura para despliegue en Kubernetes propio\" href=\"/docs/despliegue/onprem\" />",{"_8091":31,"_22651":24,"_19215":32633,"_5":22801,"_15391":32617,"_1609":32634},[],"<Card title=\"Fastlane\" description=\"Despliegue rápido y automatizado con el script Fastlane\" href=\"/docs/despliegue/onprem/fastlane\" />",{"_8091":32,"_22651":24,"_19215":32636,"_5":22801,"_15391":32621,"_1609":32637},[],"<Card title=\"AWS EC2 · AWS Marketplace\" description=\"Lanza Lamassu IoT en AWS con un clic desde el Marketplace\" href=\"/docs/despliegue/cloud\" />",{"_8091":33,"_22651":24,"_19215":32639,"_5":22801,"_15391":32624,"_1609":32640},[],"<Card title=\"SaaS · Suscripción\" descripti